---
// About section — Authentic, reflective, and systems-oriented
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="section-padding bg-surface-50/60 dark:bg-surface-950/60 relative overflow-hidden"
  aria-label="About Zulqarnain Saeed"
>
  <div class="section-container relative z-10">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Left Column (7 cols): Narrative & Engineering Philosophy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="section-label" data-reveal>Engineering Philosophy</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 mb-6 tracking-tight" data-reveal data-delay="100">
          Understanding the machine,<br />
          <span class="gradient-text">building with intent.</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed" data-reveal data-delay="200">
          <p>
            I am a Computer Science undergraduate at the <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 font-semibold">University of Central Punjab (UCP)</strong> in Lahore. While my coursework builds a rigorous mathematical and conceptual foundation in algorithms and computer systems, my learning thrives when I take those concepts and turn them into functional, testable software.
          </p>
          <p>
            I believe that true engineering excellence comes from understanding what happens below the surface. Writing C and C++ taught me memory discipline, pointer arithmetic, and algorithmic trade-offs. Implementing operating system simulations gave me respect for concurrency, process scheduling, and resource allocation.
          </p>
          <p>
            This systems-level curiosity naturally fuels my interest in <strong class="text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 font-semibold">DevOps and DevSecOps</strong>. I'm fascinated by the challenge of bridging software engineering with infrastructure reliability — automating pipelines, containerizing environments, and securing applications throughout their deployment lifecycle.
          </p>
          <p>
            To test my abilities against real-world constraints, I founded <a href="https://zentorix.netlify.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 font-semibold hover:underline">Zentorix</a>. Running it has given me early, indispensable experience: communicating directly with clients, designing responsive interfaces with Next.js and Tailwind CSS, and delivering production systems on schedule.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Four Core Pillars -->
        <div class="mt-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5" data-reveal data-delay="300">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200/80 dark:border-surface-800 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 text-sm">Fundamentals Over Trends</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Mastering data structures and systems that outlast framework churn.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200/80 dark:border-surface-800 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 text-sm">Empirical Building</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Coding working software to truly validate theoretical concepts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200/80 dark:border-surface-800 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 text-sm">Security &amp; Automation</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Proactive safety, deterministic builds, and reliable delivery pipelines.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-surface-900 border border-surface-200/80 dark:border-surface-800 shadow-sm flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 text-sm">Speed &amp; Performance</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Clean code that respects hardware cycles and user bandwidth.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column (5 cols): Academic Dossier & Quick Context -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6" data-reveal="right" data-delay="250">

        <!-- Academic Dossier Card -->
        <div class="card p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-teal-500/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
                <path d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z" />
                <path d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5zm0 0l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14zm-4 6v-7.5l4-2.222" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-2xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">
                Undergraduate Degree
              </span>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-50 text-lg leading-tight mt-0.5">
                BS Computer Science
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400 mt-1">
                University of Central Punjab (UCP) · Lahore
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-800/60 border border-surface-200/70 dark:border-surface-700/70 text-xs text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-surface-400 uppercase">Degree Period:</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-200">2024 – 2028 (Expected)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="font-mono text-2xs text-surface-400 uppercase">Current Year:</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Year 1 Undergraduate</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2 border-t border-surface-200/60 dark:border-surface-700/60 leading-relaxed text-2xs">
              <strong class="text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-200">Key Coursework:</strong> Programming Fundamentals (C/C++), Object-Oriented Design, Data Structures, Discrete Mathematics.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Summary Metrics -->
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100 text-sm mb-4">
            Profile Snapshot
          </h3>
          <dl class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-surface-100 dark:border-surface-800">
              <dt class="text-surface-500 font-mono text-xs">Primary Location</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-200">Lahore, Pakistan</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-surface-100 dark:border-surface-800">
              <dt class="text-surface-500 font-mono text-xs">Primary Languages</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-200">C, C++, Python, JavaScript</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-surface-100 dark:border-surface-800">
              <dt class="text-surface-500 font-mono text-xs">Startup Venture</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">Zentorix (Founder)</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <dt class="text-surface-500 font-mono text-xs">Career Objective</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-200">Software / DevOps Internship</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
